---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { loadPreviewDataset } from '../lib/preview-data.mjs';
import { safeSourceUrl } from '../lib/preview-model.mjs';
const dataset = loadPreviewDataset();
---
<Page title="Sources" active="sources"><main id="main" class="prose-page" tabindex="-1"><section class="intro"><div class="preview-details"><p>Record dates vary by source</p><p>{dataset.release_tag}</p></div><h1>Sources and provenance.</h1><p class="lede">Every observation retains its source identity. Publication dates, retrieval dates and reuse terms describe the source, not a claim that every record is current.</p></section>
<section class="source-list" aria-label="Sources in this preview">{dataset.sources.length ? dataset.sources.map(source => <article class="source-entry"><h2>{source.title}</h2><dl><div><dt>License or terms</dt><dd>{source.license || 'See publisher terms'}</dd></div><div><dt>Retrieved</dt><dd>{source.retrieved_at || 'Not recorded'}</dd></div><div><dt>Public redistribution</dt><dd>{source.redistribution_ok ? 'Permitted under the recorded terms and attribution requirements' : 'Not cleared for public redistribution'}</dd></div></dl>{safeSourceUrl(source.url) && <a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the publisher source</a>}</article>) : <p>No source records are loaded in this build.</p>}</section>
<section class="reading-section"><h2>Map background</h2><p>The low-resolution country boundaries are from <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Natural Earth</a>, a public-domain cartographic dataset. Boundaries are for geographic orientation and do not establish jurisdiction over a mineral asset.</p></section></main></Page>
